# LANDFALL: Wick walks four ways only, 1.25 pixels a frame; with two
# directions held the newest press wins. Walls and the ship stop her, and
# walking into the side of a block slides her round its corner. Holding A
# keeps her facing (strafe). Off an open edge the screen scrolls to the
# next room (the clock runs on, and she can't be hurt meanwhile).
game landfall
wait 5
cheat nomobs
cheat planet 1
expect state == 2
expect px == 139
expect py == 83
expect face == 2
# 16 frames right: 20 pixels, facing right
hold RIGHT 16
expect px == 159
expect py == 83
expect face == 1
# two held: the newer press wins, and she walks one axis only
hold DOWN 4
expect py == 88
hold DOWN RIGHT 8
expect px == 169
expect py == 88
expect face == 1
hold RIGHT 4
hold RIGHT UP 8
expect px == 174
expect py == 78
expect face == 0
# the ship (two tiles wide, above her) stops her
cheat pos 139 83
hold UP 20
expect py == 80
expect px == 139
# the corner slide: half under the ship's left edge, UP eases her left and on
cheat pos 122 83
hold UP 40
expect px <= 118
expect py <= 60
# the stone wall on the left
cheat pos 40 100
hold LEFT 60
expect px == 16
# strafe: A held keeps her facing down while she walks left and right
cheat pos 100 100
press DOWN 1
expect face == 2
hold A
hold A LEFT 10
expect face == 2
expect px < 100
hold A RIGHT 10
expect face == 2
release A
hold RIGHT 2
expect face == 1
# through the gap on the right (rows 3 to 6) into the next room
cheat pos 250 70
hold RIGHT 40
expect state == 4
expect room == 10
wait 40
expect state == 2
expect room == 11
expect px == 1
expect py == 70
expect time >= 80
